>
> I think that xanthian goes a bit overboard with the ultra low XL.  In
> his protection run, he believes that maximizing the AC boost and
> limiting the XL for as long as possible is useful. Personally I find
> that the cost beyond naked AC 1 to be painful and that once I've
> acquired naked AC one, that the run is over and start levelling
